{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/extras/3eebc8c049e3f67274d3e759957e5392.avif?t=1761862123\" width=1551 height=151 /></span>No\u00ebl was sunbathing outside on his lounge chair\u00a0while Francisco was bringing refreshments  when, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">suddenly\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/extras/d5b3a3b85f9a476e78d45aa609e2e201.avif?t=1761862123\" width=1463 height=930 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2026Holes appeared in the sky\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2026And candies started raining out of the holes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/extras/0e52f7e8bd1fba6cafbac592d6ba4a3c.avif?t=1761862123\" width=1551 height=423 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They looked so delicious\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/extras/0f0863b169fbb0e7a112b05f8adfae1f.avif?t=1761862123\" width=1551 height=785 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No\u00ebl gobbled\u2026 and gobbled\u2026 Until there were no candy left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/extras/641769937fac78b0528f051e4045bbe0.avif?t=1761862123\" width=1551 height=662 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once the candies vanished, a magic door appeared and transported No\u00ebl toward unknown territories\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/extras/e6cb2df6d29c3c2c51f7593f73e667a1.avif?t=1761862123\" width=1551 height=418 /></span>Where could those candies be leading No\u00ebl?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">For what mysterious reason??</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And who is behind it all???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take control of No\u00ebl and discover for yourself by exploring the strange world of <strong>GOBBLE FANTASY 2003</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/extras/f409cbab45442764e0e6623d573577b3.avif?t=1761862123\" width=1551 height=151 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/extras/0086330e8e5fc038f4ee6399cb47d970.avif?t=1761862123\" width=1551 height=1073 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/extras/c1f26d4a09a52fb9d3e44c9082dea65a.avif?t=1761862123\" width=1551 height=1073 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/extras/eb8a5333cdc8f77892308e8b9ed7e529.avif?t=1761862123\" width=1551 height=1073 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/extras/a829ef4de4f4571e9de53b6f065cbc07.avif?t=1761862123\" width=1551 height=151 /></span>To explore the land of GOBBLE FANTASY 2003, eat candies in small, action-packed mazes before venturing into larger areas filled with NPCs to talk to and turn-based battles using the powers and items you discover along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are always new surprises waiting at every level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/extras/cb65e5477f9916cf50b247c163e08504.avif?t=1761862123\" width=1551 height=528 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4049330?t=1761862123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/6b0019beaadb5f6b9570aa6c14e408314c5633c5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761862123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/604b70d1f5a6815eac7dcb6ebcd8fa1998a6e206/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761862123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/604b70d1f5a6815eac7dcb6ebcd8fa1998a6e206/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761862123","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/