Y 2003, eat candies in small, action-packed mazes before venturing into larger areas filled with NPCs to talk to and turn-based battles using the powers and items you discover along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are always new surprises waiting at every level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/extras/cb65e5477f9916cf50b247c163e08504.avif?t=1761862123\" width=1551 height=528 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Dogs Understand"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049330/bc0db541f35842c6c4ad22297947590a291991c4/header.jpg?t=1761862123","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4049330/1428942829/b8c3945b94a25631329199680d7241ea254af82f/1760482191/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760482526","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4049330/1428942829/b8c3945b94a25631329199680d7241ea254af82f/1760482191/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760482526","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4049330/1428942829/b8c3945b94a25631329199680d7241ea254af82f/1760482191/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760482526","id":257217965,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217965/movie480.mp4?t=1760482526","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217965/movie_max.mp4?t=1760482526"},"name":"Gobble Fantasy 2003","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257217965/374cb9fb2a1acac1807322c212121fdecdb7619f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760482526","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217965/movie480.webm?t=1760482526","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic